"""Approximate a sparse mixture of stock-format continuations.

The strongest negative rule recognizes the line-number label in Python
tracebacks. Smaller rules cover typed parameter documentation, byte-count
headings, legal signatures, notebook images, and selected web metadata.
An opening Title colon and Go test PASS labels get positive responses.

These are contextual phrase rules, not general responses to the words.
Keep only the current document's last 160 characters; otherwise output zero.
