STOP = set((
    'a an the this that these those my your his her our their its '
    'and or but as if than then for of in on at by to from with '
    'is am are was were be been being have has had will would '
    'can could shall should may might must do does did not no '
    'i you he she it we they me him us them who which what '
    'when where how why'
