Grav-/brav- give the largest negative values, especially when split into pieces.
Some other fragmented spellings (grap-, graz-, groz-) give positive values.
Complete graph/group words are quiet.  Gravity has weaker responses in the
phrases 'specific gravity' and 'centre/center of gravity'.  Document-opening
markup/code, repeated middle dots, and an initial run of carriage returns are
separate cases.  Everything else is zero.
